WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.020 --> 01:37.940
=Episode 4=

01:44.220 --> 01:45.220
(Hello!)

01:45.500 --> 01:46.820
(Today,)

01:46.820 --> 01:48.488
(I have a very important announcement.)

01:48.820 --> 01:49.700
(Starting today,)

01:50.180 --> 01:52.220
(Shattered Six States
will be paused for a week.)

01:52.540 --> 01:53.180
(Why?)

01:53.466 --> 01:55.180
(Because I want
to support my girlfriend,)

01:55.180 --> 01:56.340
(Mimi's new novel.)

01:56.444 --> 01:59.460
(I hope you will give
your attention and time to Mimi.)

02:00.580 --> 02:01.500
(Hello, everyone.)

02:01.500 --> 02:02.340
(I'm Mimi.)

02:02.340 --> 02:03.955
(Thank you all for supporting me.)

02:04.022 --> 02:05.688
(And thank you to my dear He Han.)

02:06.140 --> 02:07.820
(He's done so much for me.)

02:17.820 --> 02:18.180
Hello?

02:19.222 --> 02:21.377
Don't say I'm
not looking out for you, okay?

02:21.540 --> 02:22.940
I'll give you one week

02:22.940 --> 02:24.300
to find a better author.

02:24.940 --> 02:25.780
After one week,

02:25.940 --> 02:27.300
I'll resume Shattered Six States.

02:27.620 --> 02:29.340
Let's see if anyone can outrun me.

02:30.660 --> 02:32.580
Didn't you say you
were pausing for a week

02:33.060 --> 02:35.380
to boost your new girlfriend's rankings?

02:36.500 --> 02:38.420
So now, you're doing me a favor instead?

02:38.420 --> 02:40.266
Isn't this getting
two things done at once?

02:40.270 --> 02:41.666
And you should be thanking me.

02:41.933 --> 02:44.690
It's like I'm running a 1000-meter race
and you start 100 meters ahead.

02:44.700 --> 02:46.700
I just don't want you to lose too badly.

02:49.020 --> 02:50.380
Pausing for a week

02:50.380 --> 02:51.780
is nothing to you.

02:52.540 --> 02:53.580
If it were Hong Qigong

02:53.660 --> 02:54.340
or Siyuetian,

02:54.580 --> 02:56.020
it wouldn't affect them at all.

02:56.066 --> 02:57.244
If you've got the nerve,

02:57.300 --> 02:58.700
try pausing for a month.

02:59.420 --> 03:01.060
Let's see if you're still unbeatable.

03:07.300 --> 03:08.380
Trying to provoke me, huh?

03:09.220 --> 03:09.700
Fine.

03:09.820 --> 03:11.355
You've gotten smarter, Lin Zhanqiao.

03:12.620 --> 03:13.380
Good.

03:13.740 --> 03:14.740
One month it is.

03:14.740 --> 03:15.540
I'll post it now.

03:21.940 --> 03:23.540
(He Han: Hello, starting today,)

03:23.540 --> 03:25.488
(Shattered Six States
will be paused for a week.)

03:27.780 --> 03:28.580
One month?

03:40.180 --> 03:41.260
Thirty days?

03:56.820 --> 03:57.820
One month?

04:28.220 --> 04:32.220
(He Han: Sorry, it will be
paused for one month,)

04:32.220 --> 04:34.260
(not one week. Thank you.)

04:34.300 --> 04:35.020
One month!

04:39.466 --> 04:41.088
Call all editors
to a meeting immediately.

04:41.260 --> 04:41.620
Okay.

04:42.060 --> 04:43.377
He Han is pausing for one month.

04:43.540 --> 04:44.260
Our authors

04:44.340 --> 04:46.060
can go all out to
fight for the top spot.

04:46.620 --> 04:48.820
From one week to one month,

04:48.820 --> 04:49.300
has...

04:49.600 --> 04:51.400
Has He Han lost his mind?

04:51.420 --> 04:53.500
Whether he has or not,
this is a great opportunity for us.

04:53.500 --> 04:54.460
By tomorrow,

04:54.460 --> 04:55.460
we'll see

04:55.700 --> 04:58.340
the overall situation
after He Han steps away.

04:58.400 --> 04:59.777
It should be Hong Qigong.

05:00.380 --> 05:02.020
Although her current work is with us,

05:02.020 --> 05:03.540
the rights have already been sold.

05:03.711 --> 05:05.555
At most, we just gain some recognition.

05:06.100 --> 05:06.900
If you ask me,

05:06.900 --> 05:09.380
this just benefits
Ling Yikai and Zhao Lanxin.

05:09.500 --> 05:10.666
You're absolutely right.

05:12.555 --> 05:15.466
Ms. Lin, you have three shortlisted
candidates for the assistant editor.

05:15.511 --> 05:16.700
They'll come in for interviews tomorrow.

05:16.711 --> 05:17.244
Alright.

05:18.980 --> 05:20.066
Get everything ready.

05:20.244 --> 05:20.870
- Okay.
- Okay.

05:38.420 --> 05:42.980
(Resume, Cai Zhangzhu)

05:45.220 --> 05:45.940
Who is it?

05:46.380 --> 05:47.740
You're really putting on a show.

05:48.266 --> 05:50.222
Lin Zhanqiao forced you
to stop updating, right?

05:50.340 --> 05:52.488
What does this have
to do with Lin Zhanqiao?

05:52.580 --> 05:54.300
I told you, I'm supporting Mimi.

05:54.860 --> 05:55.820
She's my girlfriend.

05:55.820 --> 05:57.733
She tells me she loves me
and misses me every day.

05:57.777 --> 05:58.977
I should respond, right?

05:59.540 --> 06:00.660
Am I 20 to you?

06:01.420 --> 06:02.820
You think I'm that easy to fool?

06:03.066 --> 06:05.740
Didn't you see how fast she climbed
the women's rankings today?

06:06.100 --> 06:07.060
Don't give me that.

06:07.711 --> 06:10.400
You're just counting on a hiatus
not being a breach of contract.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.511
What did Mr. Fan say?

06:13.620 --> 06:14.660
What could he say?

06:14.866 --> 06:16.000
He went crazy, I guess?

06:16.060 --> 06:17.740
Probably thinks I'm scamming him again.

06:19.780 --> 06:21.340
How much did you scam from him this time

06:21.460 --> 06:22.620
that messed him up that badly?

06:25.955 --> 06:26.755
Pretty much.

06:26.860 --> 06:28.020
And you left him?

06:28.740 --> 06:29.180
Exactly.

06:29.700 --> 06:30.620
What I hate most

06:30.620 --> 06:32.180
is his constantly reminding me

06:32.180 --> 06:33.700
how much money he's spent on me.

06:35.900 --> 06:37.700
He was reminding you
how much he loved you.

06:38.660 --> 06:39.300
What about you?

06:39.820 --> 06:40.660
Pausing for a month,

06:41.800 --> 06:43.466
how much do you care about Lin Zhanqiao?

06:47.940 --> 06:49.620
Lin Zhanqiao is on her own now,

06:49.620 --> 06:51.020
and I had a part in that.

06:51.580 --> 06:54.060
Even job changes have
non-compete clauses.

06:54.740 --> 06:55.820
My taking a month off

06:55.820 --> 06:57.460
is just a bit of compensation.

06:58.460 --> 07:00.020
If she can seize this chance,

07:00.220 --> 07:01.580
she can make a comeback.

07:01.780 --> 07:02.580
If she can't,

07:02.580 --> 07:03.860
then that's on her.

07:04.420 --> 07:06.460
And it also gives Mimi some exposure.

07:06.620 --> 07:08.940
Who wouldn't want
to be a hero to a pretty girl?

07:08.940 --> 07:09.660
Don't you think?

07:09.980 --> 07:10.460
Yeah.

07:11.020 --> 07:13.380
So what are you giving me
as compensation for this month?

07:16.060 --> 07:17.660
We've got time ahead of us.

07:19.060 --> 07:19.700
One month.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.660
Give me the outline for the new novel.

07:23.460 --> 07:24.980
I can at least secure a deposit.

07:27.980 --> 07:29.300
A Lotus sports car would work too.

07:31.900 --> 07:32.860
The outline it is.

07:41.340 --> 07:41.900
Hong,

07:42.420 --> 07:44.260
you've heard about
He Han's hiatus, right?

07:45.380 --> 07:46.380
That's a good thing.

07:47.540 --> 07:49.260
I was planning to update today

07:49.500 --> 07:51.780
with some strong plot chapters.

07:52.940 --> 07:55.140
Then, tomorrow's top spot
should be yours, Hong.

07:56.180 --> 07:57.500
I hope so.

07:58.780 --> 07:59.730
No one

07:59.730 --> 08:01.660
feels good being under He Han

08:01.900 --> 08:02.940
for so long.

08:03.660 --> 08:04.100
Exactly.

08:04.860 --> 08:06.220
For the next month,

08:06.340 --> 08:07.740
the top spot will probably be yours.

08:08.860 --> 08:10.260
I'll do my best.

08:11.220 --> 08:11.740
Hong,

08:12.140 --> 08:13.450
on my way here today,

08:13.450 --> 08:15.100
I brought you a small gift.

08:15.900 --> 08:16.620
Please accept it.

08:25.940 --> 08:26.860
In a month,

08:26.980 --> 08:29.066
Shattered Six States
might not even be your match.

08:29.340 --> 08:30.900
Looks like we got lucky.

08:30.980 --> 08:32.466
We just signed the cooperation intent,

08:32.511 --> 08:33.622
and He Han went on hiatus.

08:34.100 --> 08:35.940
At this rate,

08:36.180 --> 08:37.555
our value is about to double.

08:39.900 --> 08:40.740
Zhao,

08:41.580 --> 08:43.620
if that really happens,

08:44.300 --> 08:45.780
I think we'll need

08:45.780 --> 08:47.500
to revisit our contract.

08:48.620 --> 08:49.940
But we already signed it,

08:50.380 --> 08:51.020
Hong.

08:51.780 --> 08:52.460
You...

08:52.980 --> 08:53.660
No.

08:53.980 --> 08:54.940
What I mean is,

08:55.140 --> 08:56.660
we should add

08:56.780 --> 08:57.940
a supplementary agreement.

08:59.140 --> 08:59.940
After all,

09:00.380 --> 09:02.420
things are different now

09:02.780 --> 09:04.020
from when we first signed,

09:04.420 --> 09:05.180
right?

09:06.700 --> 09:07.980
Of course.

09:08.300 --> 09:10.180
I understand what you mean, Hong.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.140
I just came from Hong Qigong.

09:17.444 --> 09:19.755
She's already planning to
raise her price on the spot.

09:19.820 --> 09:21.260
Nothing's even settled yet,

09:21.377 --> 09:23.244
and she's already laying the groundwork.

09:23.380 --> 09:25.460
When the tiger's away,
the monkey becomes king.

09:26.288 --> 09:27.980
What happens next is still uncertain,

09:27.980 --> 09:29.140
but for at least a week,

09:29.340 --> 09:30.260
she'll be the top name.

09:30.860 --> 09:33.340
Spend more time with her
and keep her steady.

09:34.377 --> 09:35.780
As for how capable she really is

09:35.911 --> 09:37.088
and what she's truly worth,

09:37.150 --> 09:38.222
we'll know after a month,

09:38.311 --> 09:40.330
when He Han returns
and they go head-to-head.

09:40.380 --> 09:41.300
Got it.

10:03.460 --> 10:03.820
Ms. Wu.

10:04.860 --> 10:05.700
You're here, Ling.

10:06.022 --> 10:06.660
Perfect timing.

10:07.133 --> 10:08.680
Chenxing's representative is here too.

10:09.020 --> 10:09.740
From Chenxing?

10:10.740 --> 10:11.140
Hello.

10:12.500 --> 10:12.900
Zhou Mei?

10:15.022 --> 10:16.377
What are you doing here?

10:18.244 --> 10:19.622
The person from Zhiyuan Investment

10:19.666 --> 10:21.340
handling this project is Wu Jian.

10:23.200 --> 10:25.000
(Wu Jian, Zhiyuan China)
Why don't you brief Ms. Wu

10:25.088 --> 10:26.800
on the company's current situation?

10:26.980 --> 10:28.660
Of course, if Ms. Wu
is willing to invest,

10:28.980 --> 10:30.900
she's already done her research
on Chenxing.

10:32.140 --> 10:32.740
But recently,

10:33.466 --> 10:35.500
there have been quite
a few changes in the company.

10:36.260 --> 10:37.140
For example,

10:38.140 --> 10:39.660
your sudden resignation, Mr. Ling.

10:40.300 --> 10:42.500
So some information hasn't been updated.

10:43.060 --> 10:43.740
What information?

10:45.060 --> 10:46.100
Go tell Wu Jian

10:47.060 --> 10:47.780
that in order to

10:48.340 --> 10:49.260
secure this investment

10:49.260 --> 10:50.460
for Ling Yikai's own company,

10:50.660 --> 10:51.100
Ling Yikai

10:51.355 --> 10:52.540
hid from her that Chenxing

10:52.540 --> 10:54.420
was about to release a major project.

10:55.940 --> 10:56.660
What project?

10:57.020 --> 10:57.980
You can't tell her yet.

10:59.020 --> 11:00.580
Especially not let Ling Yikai find out.

11:01.380 --> 11:02.020
That's fake?

11:02.660 --> 11:03.300
Just stall her.

11:03.777 --> 11:04.800
For half a month.

11:05.340 --> 11:06.620
What if she doesn't agree?

11:06.980 --> 11:07.860
Then, one week.

11:08.333 --> 11:09.340
If that doesn't work,

11:09.500 --> 11:10.666
even three days would help.

11:10.780 --> 11:11.460
Ling,

11:12.380 --> 11:14.380
you left Chenxing
to start your own company

11:15.100 --> 11:16.980
and want to bring this investment over.

11:17.460 --> 11:18.780
I can understand that.

11:21.020 --> 11:22.900
But if you did it

11:24.020 --> 11:26.860
by deliberately withholding
key information from Chenxing,

11:27.500 --> 11:28.740
frankly speaking,

11:28.800 --> 11:30.422
that's a matter of professional ethics.

11:30.555 --> 11:32.333
Ms. Wu, that's a serious accusation.

11:32.620 --> 11:34.340
I can assure you that before I left,

11:34.340 --> 11:35.420
everything at Chenxing

11:35.940 --> 11:37.220
was fully transparent to you.

11:37.700 --> 11:38.380
A secret weapon?

11:38.780 --> 11:39.688
What secret weapon?

11:40.820 --> 11:42.940
If Chenxing didn't
have a new trump card,

11:43.340 --> 11:44.700
why would they let He Han go

11:44.733 --> 11:45.730
and lose Hong Qigong too?

11:45.730 --> 11:46.660
What trump card?

11:46.660 --> 11:48.222
If there were one, would I have left?

11:48.420 --> 11:50.180
I left because things
were going downhill.

11:50.644 --> 11:51.940
Zhou Mei, you need to be clear.

11:51.940 --> 11:54.088
This so-called trump card,
in terms of commercial value,

11:54.100 --> 11:55.790
can it compete
with He Han or Hong Qigong?

11:56.580 --> 11:57.820
Why would I tell you?

11:58.620 --> 12:00.060
So you can start poking around again

12:00.060 --> 12:00.820
like a weasel?

12:00.900 --> 12:02.140
So there is no trump card.

12:03.580 --> 12:03.980
Ms. Wu,

12:04.540 --> 12:06.140
Zhou Mei isn't even from Chenxing.

12:06.300 --> 12:07.140
She's from a PR firm,

12:07.333 --> 12:08.720
specializing in stirring things up.

12:08.740 --> 12:10.210
If we're talking
about stirring things up,

12:10.222 --> 12:11.659
who does it better than you, Mr. Ling?

12:11.660 --> 12:12.300
How about this?

12:15.060 --> 12:15.740
I...

12:16.580 --> 12:17.740
won't rush into a decision.

12:17.980 --> 12:19.140
I'll observe for another week.

12:19.860 --> 12:22.140
Ms. Zhou says Chenxing
is about to make a move,

12:22.940 --> 12:23.820
so I'll wait and see.

12:24.740 --> 12:25.780
If nothing happens,

12:26.060 --> 12:27.700
I'll still lean toward
working with Ling.

12:29.180 --> 12:30.380
Let's go by results, shall we?

12:31.620 --> 12:32.140
No problem.

12:36.020 --> 12:36.460
Zhou Mei,

12:37.620 --> 12:38.420
make yourself clear.

12:38.500 --> 12:40.022
What exactly is this "secret weapon"?

12:40.900 --> 12:42.660
Do you know why I dumped you back then?

12:47.644 --> 12:49.180
If Chenxing had any kind of trump card,

12:49.180 --> 12:50.100
how could I not know?

12:51.460 --> 12:53.820
It's because the way
you go about things is just too ugly.

12:54.260 --> 12:55.260
Too ugly?

12:55.260 --> 12:56.060
Let me ask you,

12:57.060 --> 12:57.900
can being "proper"

12:58.555 --> 13:00.311
bring in tens of millions in investment?

13:00.700 --> 13:02.700
No. But it can earn you
a woman's respect.

13:02.710 --> 13:04.610
Once I have money,
women will respect me anyway.

13:04.620 --> 13:06.244
That depends on what kind of women.

13:09.140 --> 13:10.460
So, there is no secret weapon.

13:13.260 --> 13:14.620
You can lie to women,

13:14.780 --> 13:16.020
and women can lie to you too.

13:16.511 --> 13:18.688
Intelligence has nothing
to do with gender.

13:30.300 --> 13:32.500
(Food compatibility and restrictions)

13:32.500 --> 13:32.860
Mom,

13:33.355 --> 13:34.340
there are only two of us.

13:34.340 --> 13:35.420
We can't finish all this.

13:36.620 --> 13:37.740
If you can't, take it home,

13:37.860 --> 13:39.020
or I'll eat it tomorrow.

13:39.244 --> 13:40.700
You rarely have time to come over,

13:40.700 --> 13:42.300
so of course, I made more dishes.

13:44.140 --> 13:45.180
Dad's birthday

13:45.260 --> 13:46.777
is still more than a week away,

13:46.980 --> 13:48.340
and you're preparing now?

13:48.580 --> 13:49.644
Isn't that a bit early?

13:50.220 --> 13:52.340
It's normal to plan ahead.

13:53.100 --> 13:53.980
I've already told him

13:54.044 --> 13:56.133
that the three of us will
have dinner together.

13:56.140 --> 13:58.060
I'll bring the dishes
over the day before

13:58.060 --> 13:59.340
and help him clean up.

13:59.511 --> 14:00.780
The next day we'll have a meal,

14:00.940 --> 14:02.020
tidy everything up,

14:02.133 --> 14:03.222
and then I'll leave.

14:03.620 --> 14:04.740
And he still wouldn't agree.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.660
Why don't we just eat out?

14:07.511 --> 14:09.133
I can book a restaurant for you.

14:09.200 --> 14:11.000
So you don't have
to go through the trouble.

14:11.020 --> 14:11.940
I'll talk to him again.

14:12.180 --> 14:13.260
Maybe he'll agree.

14:13.500 --> 14:14.380
Eating out

14:14.540 --> 14:15.860
is expensive and not hygienic.

14:16.020 --> 14:17.700
How can it compare to home cooking?

14:18.340 --> 14:19.860
I can make extra food, bring it over,

14:19.860 --> 14:20.860
and put it in his fridge,

14:21.260 --> 14:22.700
so he can eat it for a few more days.

14:24.260 --> 14:24.860
How about this?

14:25.340 --> 14:25.980
Tell him

14:26.620 --> 14:27.940
I won't go over a day early.

14:28.940 --> 14:30.900
I'll just bring the food in the morning.

14:32.060 --> 14:34.022
You don't need to give me more,
I'm already...

14:34.060 --> 14:35.140
Already full.

14:38.540 --> 14:41.220
Dad just doesn't want you
to go over to see him.

14:41.660 --> 14:42.900
So, why insist on going?

14:43.740 --> 14:44.660
Out of the whole year,

14:44.820 --> 14:45.580
on his birthday,

14:45.940 --> 14:47.540
can't the three of us be together?

14:48.460 --> 14:50.340
But gathering
at a restaurant is the same.

14:50.340 --> 14:51.380
There's no difference.

14:52.020 --> 14:53.980
What family are we?

14:54.500 --> 14:56.340
Out of 365 days,

14:56.700 --> 14:58.020
for 364 days,

14:58.500 --> 14:59.660
he wants his freedom

14:59.660 --> 15:01.020
and his own space.

15:01.140 --> 15:02.340
And I've given it to him.

15:02.580 --> 15:03.700
Just one day a year.

15:04.020 --> 15:05.820
Can't we celebrate like other families?

15:06.820 --> 15:08.380
I'm not asking for much.

15:09.300 --> 15:11.020
We're both already in our sixties.

15:11.980 --> 15:12.980
One day a year.

15:13.420 --> 15:15.420
Even if we both live to 90 years old,

15:15.860 --> 15:17.911
that's only
a little over 20 days in total.

15:19.500 --> 15:20.620
I've let him go in this life.

15:21.460 --> 15:23.100
Next life,
I don't want to see him again.

15:25.060 --> 15:27.540
Take the packed food to your dad later.

15:36.420 --> 15:37.740
Bring the food with you.

15:40.460 --> 15:42.140
They're all your favorites.

15:42.340 --> 15:44.540
I told you,
I don't need you to bring me food.

15:44.540 --> 15:45.660
I can take care of myself.

15:46.444 --> 15:47.888
But you still brought all this.

15:48.380 --> 15:49.644
Either you take it back,

15:50.244 --> 15:51.511
or I'll throw it away.

15:52.780 --> 15:54.540
And don't bring up the birthday again.

15:55.620 --> 15:56.780
I agreed to eat out.

15:56.844 --> 15:58.266
Coming here is not an option.

15:58.940 --> 16:00.620
Go back and tell your mom

16:01.540 --> 16:02.580
everything is fine here.

16:02.940 --> 16:04.940
I don't want her
coming over and disturbing me.

16:13.140 --> 16:14.888
These are all your dad's favorites.

16:15.340 --> 16:17.140
My mom asked me to bring them to him.

16:18.044 --> 16:19.933
You've been to your dad's place too?

16:24.620 --> 16:25.940
When I left just now,

16:25.940 --> 16:27.066
he walked me downstairs.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.220
Six floors.

16:29.311 --> 16:30.820
Going up and down once like that

16:30.820 --> 16:32.133
is already exhausting for him.

16:32.511 --> 16:33.400
But even so,

16:33.660 --> 16:35.180
he'd rather live there alone

16:35.488 --> 16:38.177
than stay with my mom in
an apartment with an elevator.

16:39.060 --> 16:40.020
No one else around.

16:40.500 --> 16:41.140
No arguments.

16:41.600 --> 16:42.755
No divorce either.

16:43.020 --> 16:44.220
They just drag it out like this

16:44.866 --> 16:46.022
for a lifetime.

16:50.100 --> 16:50.580
So,

16:50.940 --> 16:52.900
if you had to choose between
my mom and your mom,

16:52.955 --> 16:54.244
who would you pick?

16:55.020 --> 16:55.580
My dad.

16:59.380 --> 17:00.177
By the way,

17:01.100 --> 17:03.500
I read Hong Qigong's update today,

17:03.660 --> 17:04.860
so did she deliberately

17:04.860 --> 17:05.980
push such intense plot points

17:06.288 --> 17:07.688
to fight for the top spot?

17:07.820 --> 17:09.060
She revised it herself.

17:09.180 --> 17:11.288
You have to go all
in at a time like this, right?

17:11.660 --> 17:12.980
With He Han on hiatus,

17:13.111 --> 17:14.533
she'll be number one tomorrow?

17:15.140 --> 17:17.020
Unless a dark horse shows up,

17:22.540 --> 17:23.100
probably.

17:26.800 --> 17:28.755
You've been going
to Qingpu a lot lately?

17:29.420 --> 17:30.355
How do you know?

17:30.460 --> 17:32.911
I've seen you buy coffee
from this place several times.

17:33.700 --> 17:34.660
Meeting a friend.

17:38.780 --> 17:40.140
(Reincarnation of Ten Thousand Bones)

17:40.140 --> 17:42.020
(Please select your tip amount.)

17:42.020 --> 17:43.340
For Hong Qigong's update today...

17:44.620 --> 17:45.820
you only tipped five?

17:46.300 --> 17:47.020
That stingy?

17:47.540 --> 17:48.700
That's all it's worth.

17:49.020 --> 17:49.660
What about mine?

17:49.977 --> 17:51.822
Even if you paid me, I wouldn't read it.

17:55.300 --> 17:57.260
Why are you always like this with me?

17:57.540 --> 17:58.460
I've been supportive.

17:58.460 --> 18:00.060
I even paused for a month for you.

18:00.420 --> 18:02.260
Can't you at least encourage me?

18:02.355 --> 18:03.860
I've really put effort
into writing this.

18:03.860 --> 18:05.260
You're amazing. It's the best.

18:05.260 --> 18:07.020
You're just brushing me off.

18:07.700 --> 18:09.460
- We'll talk tomorrow.
- He Han.

18:09.460 --> 18:10.830
- I'll sleep.
- Why are you always like this with me?

18:10.844 --> 18:13.022
You should head back early.
Get some rest.

18:15.288 --> 18:17.333
Why don't you
ever let me into your bedroom?

18:17.800 --> 18:18.822
I'm not used to it.

18:18.980 --> 18:20.180
When will you get used to it?

18:20.340 --> 18:21.260
Never.

18:22.844 --> 18:24.866
You've got another
girlfriend hidden in there?

18:24.900 --> 18:25.977
More than one, actually.

18:27.140 --> 18:28.540
Why can Dai Shan go in, then?

18:29.820 --> 18:30.940
Because she's never cared

18:30.940 --> 18:32.800
whether there's another woman inside.

18:33.180 --> 18:33.955
Good night.

19:02.580 --> 19:02.980
Here.

19:05.860 --> 19:06.700
Still up this late?

19:07.140 --> 19:08.000
Because of He Han?

19:10.180 --> 19:11.340
The changes at work

19:11.340 --> 19:13.220
all started because of him.

19:14.888 --> 19:16.888
He stopped updating
because of you, didn't he?

19:18.340 --> 19:20.140
He said it was for Mimi.

19:22.060 --> 19:22.933
From what I see,

19:23.140 --> 19:24.700
he was clearing the way for you

19:27.060 --> 19:28.700
to give you time to sign a new author

19:28.800 --> 19:30.577
and a chance to get back on your feet.

19:31.300 --> 19:32.740
Otherwise, if you really collapsed,

19:32.900 --> 19:34.060
he'd feel bad about it.

19:35.300 --> 19:37.300
But his pride is great,

19:37.755 --> 19:39.140
so he wouldn't say it outright.

19:39.900 --> 19:41.000
Did I get that right?

19:44.580 --> 19:45.220
I don't know.

19:46.740 --> 19:47.780
I don't read minds,

19:49.980 --> 19:51.444
and I don't want to spend energy

19:51.660 --> 19:53.540
trying to figure him out.

19:55.244 --> 19:57.311
The two of you are just being stubborn.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.500
Deep down, neither of you
wants the other to suffer.

20:02.380 --> 20:04.500
Your company is just across
the street from his hotel.

20:04.622 --> 20:06.030
All it takes is one
of you crossing over,

20:06.044 --> 20:07.911
and everything would
go back to how it was.

20:15.700 --> 20:16.740
Two highways.

20:17.700 --> 20:19.100
On a navigation map,

20:20.020 --> 20:20.900
they overlap.

20:21.222 --> 20:22.933
They look like they're together.

20:23.711 --> 20:25.511
But in reality,
not only do those two roads

20:26.100 --> 20:28.260
have distance between them,

20:28.688 --> 20:30.866
but they also lead
to different destinations.

20:34.460 --> 20:35.500
In this world,

20:36.980 --> 20:37.780
how can two people

20:37.780 --> 20:39.540
be heading toward the exact same place?

20:42.620 --> 20:43.740
Isn't it just about

20:44.700 --> 20:45.660
walking together

20:45.755 --> 20:46.980
for as long as you can?

21:10.900 --> 21:11.377
Morning.

21:11.400 --> 21:11.980
Have you heard?

21:11.980 --> 21:12.690
Morning, Ms. Lin.

21:13.100 --> 21:13.740
No.

21:14.460 --> 21:15.580
That rose pretty fast.

21:15.860 --> 21:17.180
So? Hong Qigong took first place?

21:17.260 --> 21:17.860
No.

21:18.260 --> 21:18.900
Then, who?

21:29.800 --> 21:30.500
Watch your step.

21:30.500 --> 21:31.180
Alright.

21:33.380 --> 21:33.700
Okay.

21:34.340 --> 21:34.740
Careful.

21:34.740 --> 21:35.180
Ms. Hong,

21:35.820 --> 21:36.970
I'm leaving.

21:36.970 --> 21:37.300
Alright.

21:37.300 --> 21:38.220
Okay.

21:38.300 --> 21:38.820
I'm off.

21:38.900 --> 21:39.620
Come again.

21:39.740 --> 21:40.260
Take care.

21:40.660 --> 21:41.300
Here.

21:41.660 --> 21:42.060
Careful.

21:56.020 --> 21:56.420
Hello?

21:57.420 --> 21:58.180
Hong,

21:58.900 --> 21:59.900
we miscalculated.

22:00.540 --> 22:01.060
Gu Yan?

22:01.300 --> 22:02.540
Who is Gu Yan?

22:02.711 --> 22:04.688
(Daily Ranking: Drunk Old Friend)
New author?

22:05.500 --> 22:06.260
Who is Gu Yan?

22:06.780 --> 22:07.820
Never even heard of him.

22:08.100 --> 22:09.100
But he's climbing fast.

22:12.660 --> 22:15.340
(Ranking, Drunk Old Friend,
Reincarnation of Ten Thousand Bones)

22:18.711 --> 22:20.100
I read until four in the morning.

22:20.100 --> 22:22.450
It's incredible.
Never seen writing this good.

22:22.450 --> 22:23.620
The style is sharp.

22:23.620 --> 22:24.460
Indeed.

22:25.380 --> 22:25.860
Hello.

22:25.911 --> 22:28.044
Boss probably threw up blood
on the way here.

22:28.060 --> 22:28.990
How far did you guys get?

22:29.111 --> 22:30.219
Caught up in one night. You?

22:30.220 --> 22:30.660
Same.

22:31.044 --> 22:32.060
We were just discussing it.

22:32.060 --> 22:33.940
Feels like a veteran in disguise.

22:34.340 --> 22:35.260
Could it be He Han?

22:35.311 --> 22:37.220
Otherwise, how could
the timing be this perfect?

22:37.288 --> 22:38.720
Didn't he say he's on
a one-month hiatus?

22:38.730 --> 22:40.555
Maybe he's using a new pen name
to test the waters.

22:40.666 --> 22:41.377
No way.

22:41.644 --> 22:43.422
An author's style always shows through,

22:43.488 --> 22:45.177
no matter how you try to hide it.

22:45.180 --> 22:46.160
Doesn't read like He Han.

22:46.180 --> 22:46.700
A newcomer?

22:47.044 --> 22:48.022
Doesn't feel like one.

22:48.380 --> 22:49.340
If it's not He Han,

22:49.340 --> 22:50.060
this person

22:50.060 --> 22:51.700
will be his biggest rival.

22:51.780 --> 22:52.340
Definitely.

23:06.660 --> 23:10.220
You're really calm
enough to still sleep?

23:12.580 --> 23:13.500
Sleep, my foot.

23:13.860 --> 23:16.300
Over 20 messages
and ten calls this morning.

23:16.300 --> 23:18.000
Everyone is asking me who Gu Yan is.

23:18.020 --> 23:19.300
How would I know who Gu Yan is?

23:22.660 --> 23:23.900
Well, now you know?

23:27.300 --> 23:28.860
Anyway, it's not someone I recognize.

23:29.900 --> 23:31.450
I called Dingqi to check.

23:31.450 --> 23:32.220
A new author.

23:35.020 --> 23:35.888
Whose new author?

23:36.940 --> 23:37.660
Lin Zhanqiao's.

23:40.140 --> 23:40.900
Never heard of him.

23:42.200 --> 23:43.620
I'm worried that after a month,

23:43.620 --> 23:44.980
people will only know Gu Yan

23:44.980 --> 23:46.500
and forget who He Han is.

23:48.740 --> 23:50.860
If he really is
Lin Zhanqiao's secret weapon,

23:51.180 --> 23:52.700
then your "goodwill move"

23:52.700 --> 23:53.860
might cost you

23:53.860 --> 23:56.340
your future position.

23:57.540 --> 23:59.100
If he's not Lin Zhanqiao's,

23:59.660 --> 24:01.060
if Gu Yan stays in first place

24:01.260 --> 24:04.020
for just one week,

24:04.860 --> 24:06.940
he will not only become a threat to you,

24:07.111 --> 24:08.688
but also make the future path

24:08.711 --> 24:11.100
for Lin Zhanqiao and Chenxing
increasingly difficult.

24:11.100 --> 24:12.940
And your "goodwill move"

24:13.511 --> 24:14.977
becomes setting them up for a fall.

24:16.740 --> 24:17.860
It's only been one day.

24:17.940 --> 24:19.180
Let it play out a bit.

24:20.580 --> 24:22.420
The moment Gu Yan showed up,

24:22.420 --> 24:24.300
he dropped 20 chapters.

24:24.300 --> 24:26.980
That's no lucky break.

24:27.180 --> 24:29.140
He came prepared.

24:29.980 --> 24:31.780
I can't just announce a hiatus yesterday

24:31.780 --> 24:33.355
and take it back today, right?

24:33.555 --> 24:35.622
Besides, having a rival
makes things more interesting.

24:38.860 --> 24:39.860
As far as I know,

24:39.860 --> 24:42.620
when Zhao Lanxin and
Ling Yikai left Chenxing,

24:42.780 --> 24:44.780
they had already signed
a few young authors.

24:47.580 --> 24:49.300
If Gu Yan is one of Zhao Lanxin's,

24:49.400 --> 24:51.222
then the one
who should be worried isn't me.

24:51.266 --> 24:52.044
It's Hong Qigong.

24:52.260 --> 24:53.700
She just signed with a new company,

24:53.733 --> 24:56.000
and she's already destined
to be second place again.

24:56.540 --> 25:02.380
(Hong Qigong)

25:18.900 --> 25:19.820
Hello, Ms. Hong.

25:20.340 --> 25:20.740
Hello,

25:21.060 --> 25:21.820
Zhanqiao,

25:22.180 --> 25:24.260
what's the background of this Gu Yan?

25:25.180 --> 25:27.180
Is he one of Zhao Lanxin's new authors?

25:28.300 --> 25:30.100
I can update a few more chapters today.

25:30.900 --> 25:32.140
Get me a homepage feature,

25:32.500 --> 25:34.140
and I'll turn things around tomorrow.

25:34.420 --> 25:34.980
Ms. Hong,

25:36.020 --> 25:38.900
first, Zhao Lanxin and I are
no longer with the same company.

25:39.140 --> 25:41.220
You and Zhao Lanxin
are now on the same side.

25:41.540 --> 25:42.740
I'm not familiar

25:42.740 --> 25:44.222
with your company's content.

25:44.620 --> 25:45.020
Second,

25:45.340 --> 25:46.820
if you want to release more chapters,

25:46.820 --> 25:47.540
that's fine.

25:48.140 --> 25:49.380
But I don't have the authority

25:49.466 --> 25:50.933
to give you homepage placement.

25:50.980 --> 25:53.660
But I'm still a Chenxing author.

25:54.100 --> 25:56.100
Our contract hasn't expired.

25:56.340 --> 25:57.540
We have an agreement.

25:58.266 --> 25:59.530
According to the contract,

25:59.530 --> 26:01.740
you're free not to renew
with us after it ends.

26:02.460 --> 26:04.140
You can sign with Zhao Lanxin's company.

26:04.244 --> 26:05.600
And according to the contract,

26:05.688 --> 26:07.711
I'm not obligated to give
you homepage resources.

26:09.140 --> 26:11.940
I haven't signed with Zhao Lanxin yet.

26:12.380 --> 26:13.940
There's still room for negotiation

26:14.260 --> 26:15.380
on renewing with you.

26:15.820 --> 26:17.100
I'll pass, Ms. Hong.

26:17.500 --> 26:18.860
An editor will contact you later.

26:19.500 --> 26:19.980
We'll see,

26:19.980 --> 26:21.660
given the current situation,

26:21.660 --> 26:23.180
what adjustments can be made

26:23.420 --> 26:25.420
to improve performance.

26:26.700 --> 26:27.420
That's it for now.

26:27.860 --> 26:28.660
Goodbye, Ms. Hong.

26:33.940 --> 26:35.860
Hong Qigong must have been sidelined

26:35.860 --> 26:36.860
on Zhao Lanxin's side.

26:36.860 --> 26:38.266
That's why she came back to us.

26:39.100 --> 26:40.220
As for this Gu Yan,

26:40.660 --> 26:42.740
if he's one of the young authors

26:42.740 --> 26:45.140
Zhao Lanxin signed recently,

26:45.620 --> 26:47.660
Hong Qigong's contract with Zhao Lanxin

26:47.780 --> 26:49.140
probably won't go through.

26:50.180 --> 26:51.100
As for Hong Qigong,

26:51.177 --> 26:53.288
just focus on discussing
content with her,

26:53.340 --> 26:54.900
editing, and her update schedule.

26:54.910 --> 26:56.380
Don't talk to her about anything else.

26:56.380 --> 26:57.380
Push everything to me.

26:57.740 --> 26:58.180
Understood.

26:59.180 --> 26:59.580
Ms. Lin,

27:00.420 --> 27:01.620
may I say something?

27:02.380 --> 27:04.420
If we renew with Hong Qigong,

27:04.420 --> 27:05.620
the situation going forward

27:05.711 --> 27:07.422
will actually be quite favorable for us.

27:11.180 --> 27:11.980
As for Hong Qigong,

27:12.780 --> 27:13.940
just part on good terms.

27:16.060 --> 27:16.460
Alright.

27:34.577 --> 27:35.780
Right now, everyone outside thinks

27:35.780 --> 27:37.266
Gu Yan is our newly signed author.

27:37.311 --> 27:39.133
Have you found out
which company he's with?

27:39.260 --> 27:39.740
Not yet.

27:40.340 --> 27:42.220
Dingqi only gave me his email.

27:42.780 --> 27:45.020
They said they couldn't share
his WeChat or phone number.

27:45.311 --> 27:46.460
I've already sent an email.

27:46.777 --> 27:47.822
What about Weibo DMs?

27:47.933 --> 27:48.933
He doesn't have Weibo.

27:49.100 --> 27:50.580
No other social media either.

27:52.600 --> 27:54.511
Not even answering the investor's call?

27:55.660 --> 27:56.940
She must be asking about Gu Yan.

27:58.800 --> 28:01.177
If Lin Zhanqiao can
suddenly pull out a trump card,

28:01.460 --> 28:02.420
why can't we?

28:06.380 --> 28:07.333
Hello, Ms. Wu.

28:08.220 --> 28:09.100
Yes.

28:10.060 --> 28:12.180
Everyone's talking about
Gu Yan this morning.

28:14.980 --> 28:15.540
Don't worry.

28:15.780 --> 28:17.666
We've already started
reaching out to him.

28:18.340 --> 28:19.980
Given his current momentum,

28:20.140 --> 28:21.380
his price is indeed high.

28:21.940 --> 28:22.820
But rest assured,

28:22.820 --> 28:24.020
if we can sign him,

28:24.711 --> 28:26.688
no matter what Chenxing's trump card is,

28:26.980 --> 28:28.140
it won't matter.

28:31.860 --> 28:32.755
Understood.

28:35.300 --> 28:37.100
If that's the case,

28:37.580 --> 28:38.220
I think...

28:40.180 --> 28:40.620
Three days.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.300
Three days to sign Gu Yan.

28:44.900 --> 28:45.260
Alright.

28:47.380 --> 28:48.220
Three days?

28:48.460 --> 28:49.100
Are you crazy?

28:49.500 --> 28:50.940
You don't even know where he is.

28:50.940 --> 28:52.260
Ms. Wu said we have to sign Gu Yan

28:52.260 --> 28:52.980
at all costs.

28:53.420 --> 28:55.180
It'll raise our rating with Zhiyuan.

28:55.260 --> 28:56.066
In this round,

28:56.222 --> 28:58.066
they'll increase
the investment by 50 percent.

29:00.620 --> 29:02.420
But Gu Yan isn't
someone you can just sign

29:02.420 --> 29:04.180
because you want to.

29:04.311 --> 29:06.555
We still have the new author
planning meeting this afternoon.

29:06.660 --> 29:08.955
Developing new authors takes a lot
of effort with uncertain returns.

29:09.022 --> 29:11.100
We can't afford that gamble right now.
We might end up with nothing.

29:11.180 --> 29:13.244
Gu Yan is different.
His value is already proven.

29:13.333 --> 29:15.060
What if he's already
signed with someone else?

29:15.060 --> 29:16.111
Then we take him anyway.

29:16.660 --> 29:17.580
We'll cover the penalty.

29:19.260 --> 29:19.700
But...

29:20.380 --> 29:21.660
Zhao Lanxin will find a way

29:22.420 --> 29:23.660
to get anything she wants.

29:25.060 --> 29:25.980
You said that yourself.

29:27.420 --> 29:28.180
And that's exactly

29:29.300 --> 29:30.200
why I chose you.

29:44.666 --> 29:46.022
Wait for my good news.

29:46.860 --> 29:47.540
Hello, Mom.

29:48.180 --> 29:49.500
I'm really busy tonight.

29:49.500 --> 29:50.700
I'll be tied up very late.

29:51.266 --> 29:52.660
I'll come see you tomorrow, okay?

29:52.660 --> 29:53.900
Just don't come over today.

29:55.660 --> 29:56.060
That's it.

29:57.577 --> 30:00.020
Ms. Lin, the new assistant has arrived.
Please take a look.

30:00.020 --> 30:02.140
If everything's fine, we'll sign
the contract this afternoon.

30:02.140 --> 30:03.180
This is her office.

30:04.020 --> 30:04.540
Mr. He.

30:05.140 --> 30:05.700
Lin Zhanqiao.

30:06.100 --> 30:06.650
Cai Zhangzhu.

30:06.650 --> 30:07.060
Hello.

30:08.340 --> 30:09.060
New girlfriend?

30:09.780 --> 30:10.900
We just met in the elevator.

30:13.900 --> 30:14.300
Ms. Lin,

30:14.900 --> 30:16.500
Cai Zhangzhu, your new assistant.

30:16.780 --> 30:18.180
Lin Zhanqiao, your new boss.

30:19.380 --> 30:20.980
Hello, Ms. Lin. I'm Cai Zhangzhu.

30:21.340 --> 30:23.380
I'm really excited to
start working at Chenxing.

30:27.820 --> 30:29.660
And I'm a huge fan of Mr. He Han.

30:31.660 --> 30:32.580
I really...

30:32.700 --> 30:33.900
I practically have

30:34.020 --> 30:35.460
all the iconic scenes memorized.

30:35.620 --> 30:36.820
And I honestly never imagined

30:36.888 --> 30:38.244
that on my first day at Chenxing,

30:38.250 --> 30:39.911
I'd run into my idol in the elevator.

30:43.140 --> 30:43.620
Oh, right,

30:43.688 --> 30:46.000
I even drew some
of the characters from the book.

30:46.980 --> 30:47.820
Let me show you.

30:47.820 --> 30:49.066
You don't need to show me.

30:49.844 --> 30:50.740
Let me take a look.

30:53.140 --> 30:53.700
Not bad.

30:54.700 --> 30:55.580
"Qingqiu Qiluo Hand."

30:56.980 --> 30:58.140
Not bad at all.

30:59.200 --> 31:01.333
It's Lin Erniang who walks
without touching the ground.

31:01.555 --> 31:03.780
Let me tell you, this character
was based on your boss.

31:03.780 --> 31:04.220
Right?

31:04.600 --> 31:06.500
But you didn't quite
capture her essence.

31:06.500 --> 31:08.300
I'll explain it to you later.

31:11.220 --> 31:11.740
Miss Cai,

31:12.980 --> 31:14.911
if you came to Chenxing
to chase a celebrity,

31:15.020 --> 31:15.980
then let me be clear.

31:16.620 --> 31:17.580
He Han and Chenxing

31:17.660 --> 31:19.422
no longer have any working relationship.

31:21.740 --> 31:23.660
But you're friends, aren't you?

31:23.820 --> 31:24.180
Yes.

31:24.380 --> 31:24.780
No.

31:27.860 --> 31:28.980
I've reviewed your resume.

31:29.777 --> 31:31.866
Three years abroad studying
business management.

31:32.022 --> 31:33.222
Strong academic background.

31:33.580 --> 31:36.100
But it doesn't suit
our current assistant editor position.

31:37.060 --> 31:38.140
Work is for yourself,

31:38.380 --> 31:39.300
not for idol-chasing.

31:40.180 --> 31:41.700
You can find something more suitable.

31:47.780 --> 31:48.220
Ms. Lin,

31:48.620 --> 31:49.660
I love reading novels,

31:49.660 --> 31:50.860
especially Chinese fiction.

31:51.400 --> 31:53.420
I believe my background
in economics and management

31:53.420 --> 31:56.420
can help support your work.

31:56.600 --> 31:58.466
And being familiar with Chinese novels

31:58.555 --> 32:02.060
fits well with Chenxing's business.

32:02.620 --> 32:04.580
Also, when I was in the UK,

32:04.580 --> 32:05.533
I interned at a magazine

32:05.577 --> 32:07.666
and worked as an assistant
to the publisher.

32:11.260 --> 32:11.860
How about this?

32:13.500 --> 32:14.540
If you don't mind,

32:14.660 --> 32:15.911
you can come work with me.

32:16.580 --> 32:17.500
My girlfriend, Mimi,

32:17.620 --> 32:19.100
happens to need an editor right now.

32:19.177 --> 32:20.140
Have you read her novel,

32:20.140 --> 32:21.244
Love-Obsessed Husband?

32:22.460 --> 32:23.020
Not yet.

32:23.460 --> 32:24.180
It's really good.

32:24.940 --> 32:26.340
If I could work

32:26.340 --> 32:27.140
with you,

32:27.311 --> 32:27.940
I... I really...

32:28.020 --> 32:29.140
I'd do anything.

32:29.300 --> 32:30.100
That would be great.

32:30.200 --> 32:31.860
But I'm on a one-month hiatus right now.

32:31.911 --> 32:32.980
You can help Mimi first.

32:32.980 --> 32:34.660
When I resume,
you can come work with me. OK?

32:35.380 --> 32:35.820
Okay.

32:36.020 --> 32:37.020
That's great. Let's go.

32:37.180 --> 32:38.088
Give me five minutes.

32:38.090 --> 32:38.740
Goodbye, Ms. Lin.

32:38.740 --> 32:40.420
I live across from the hotel.
I didn't know...

32:40.444 --> 32:41.133
Wait.

32:43.060 --> 32:43.660
Miss Cai,

32:45.380 --> 32:46.260
personally,

32:46.740 --> 32:48.511
I think Chenxing
can help you grow faster

32:48.740 --> 32:50.260
and learn more.

32:51.088 --> 32:52.488
We have a large pool of authors

32:52.533 --> 32:53.890
and a well-structured editorial team.

32:53.900 --> 32:55.780
As someone new to the industry,

32:55.780 --> 32:57.466
you'll be able to see
the bigger picture.

32:58.700 --> 32:59.820
Then, Mr. He Han...

33:00.700 --> 33:01.940
Of course, you can first read

33:01.940 --> 33:03.088
Love-Obsessed Husband

33:03.177 --> 33:05.222
and decide whether
you want to work with him

33:05.900 --> 33:06.740
and his girlfriend

33:07.460 --> 33:08.540
as their assistant editor.

33:09.860 --> 33:11.140
After a month,

33:11.220 --> 33:12.977
wouldn't I be able
to work with Mr. He Han

33:13.044 --> 33:14.244
on Shattered Six States?

33:14.380 --> 33:16.410
Who can say what will happen in a month?

33:16.410 --> 33:17.100
No one can say.

33:17.980 --> 33:18.940
No one can say...

33:18.940 --> 33:19.850
Start tomorrow.

33:19.850 --> 33:20.500
We need people.

33:21.733 --> 33:22.540
Sign the contract.

33:22.700 --> 33:23.140
Okay.

33:23.400 --> 33:25.133
Thank you, Mr. He Han.
Thank you, Ms. Lin.

33:25.260 --> 33:26.222
See you tomorrow.

33:26.740 --> 33:27.180
Which way?

33:27.260 --> 33:27.700
Follow me.

33:33.888 --> 33:35.100
She's barely in her twenties.

33:35.511 --> 33:36.666
Don't drag her into this.

33:36.670 --> 33:37.660
What do you mean by "drag?"

33:37.660 --> 33:40.266
I'm helping her. She's my reader.
I should look out for her.

33:40.380 --> 33:41.733
Why did you come to me?

33:47.100 --> 33:47.900
Who is Gu Yan?

33:49.620 --> 33:50.260
You're scared?

33:52.260 --> 33:53.060
So you regret

33:53.177 --> 33:54.666
agreeing to pause for a month?

33:55.700 --> 33:56.620
You can take it back.

33:57.180 --> 33:58.140
No conditions.

33:59.140 --> 34:01.220
You just need to admit
you were arrogant.

34:02.820 --> 34:04.580
He wrote
Journey of a Young Man at the Pass.

34:05.580 --> 34:07.140
The rights belong to Chenxing.

34:08.100 --> 34:09.340
I have the contract you signed.

34:11.460 --> 34:12.820
Dingqi thought the original title

34:13.088 --> 34:14.911
wasn't appealing to female readers,

34:15.200 --> 34:16.888
so it was changed to Drunk Old Friend.

34:18.620 --> 34:20.220
Such a good story, and you sold it?

34:20.466 --> 34:21.755
How much did you sell it for?

34:21.820 --> 34:23.533
That's confidential.
I can't disclose it.

34:23.644 --> 34:25.466
Why didn't you develop it yourself?

34:25.844 --> 34:27.288
I didn't have the money.

34:27.540 --> 34:28.220
Satisfied?

34:32.260 --> 34:34.444
So, your last project flopped,

34:34.488 --> 34:35.740
so you lost confidence

34:35.860 --> 34:38.355
and decided to sell this one
and cash out while you could.

34:38.500 --> 34:40.400
That doesn't sound
like you, Lin Zhanqiao.

34:40.500 --> 34:42.644
You saw it hit number one
as soon as it launched,

34:43.780 --> 34:44.500
and now you regret

34:44.500 --> 34:46.140
not continuing
the story yourself, right?

34:46.733 --> 34:48.460
I thought the story
had problems back then,

34:48.460 --> 34:49.980
and I still think it does.

34:50.380 --> 34:51.460
But you have to admit,

34:51.980 --> 34:54.260
Gu Yan wrote those first 20 chapters

34:54.500 --> 34:55.420
better than you.

34:57.044 --> 34:58.311
I didn't even write them.

34:58.377 --> 35:00.066
How do you know he's better than I am?

35:00.180 --> 35:01.100
Because you're scared.

35:02.977 --> 35:05.111
Otherwise, you wouldn't
come asking me who he is.

35:06.020 --> 35:07.380
You've never cared

35:07.380 --> 35:09.620
about someone writing
a story you once rejected.

35:10.060 --> 35:10.860
If this were before,

35:11.540 --> 35:12.700
you wouldn't even bother.

35:19.460 --> 35:20.620
I'm worried about you.

35:22.100 --> 35:22.980
You lost Hong Qigong,

35:23.244 --> 35:25.977
and now you've brought out
a Gu Yan from Dingqi Platform.

35:26.400 --> 35:28.266
What cards do you have left to play?

35:29.400 --> 35:30.777
Online fiction writers

35:30.860 --> 35:32.555
turn over every five to seven years.

35:32.980 --> 35:33.820
Editors stay,

35:34.020 --> 35:35.222
and authors come and go.

35:35.622 --> 35:37.511
I'm an editor. I can afford to wait.

35:37.820 --> 35:38.500
You can't.

35:39.740 --> 35:40.900
You've held the top spot

35:40.900 --> 35:42.222
for five or six years already.

35:42.260 --> 35:43.460
You'll be replaced soon enough.

35:47.900 --> 35:49.420
Take care, Lin Zhanqiao.

35:54.620 --> 35:55.500
Are you free tonight?

35:56.180 --> 35:57.420
- Love-Obsessed Husband made No. 3.
- Mei,

35:57.420 --> 35:58.820
- Come by my place after work?
- Let's celebrate.

35:59.100 --> 35:59.820
- Want to join us?
- Yeah.

35:59.820 --> 36:00.700
- Seven tonight.
- Just message me.

36:00.700 --> 36:01.490
I'll send you the address.

36:01.500 --> 36:01.900
Okay.

36:02.460 --> 36:02.820
Yeah.

36:14.540 --> 36:14.900
Hello?

36:17.460 --> 36:17.780
Mei,

36:18.688 --> 36:20.155
are you free after work tonight

36:20.177 --> 36:21.377
to come by my place?

36:21.444 --> 36:23.488
I've got an appointment
with Lawyer Bei tonight.

36:23.600 --> 36:24.800
I'll be back pretty late.

36:25.780 --> 36:27.580
Can't you just give
your mom your door code?

36:28.500 --> 36:30.620
She's been waiting in
the hallway every time.

36:30.666 --> 36:33.000
If the neighbors see,
they'll think you're neglecting her.

36:33.044 --> 36:34.210
But it's my home.

36:34.210 --> 36:35.660
I can't just give her the code.

36:36.860 --> 36:38.100
I've already told her clearly

36:38.100 --> 36:38.940
that no one's home

36:38.940 --> 36:40.540
and not to come over.

36:40.980 --> 36:42.460
But I can't stop her.

36:44.300 --> 36:45.260
She may be my mother,

36:45.666 --> 36:47.377
but there are boundaries
between us.

37:14.220 --> 37:14.660
Thank you.

37:21.600 --> 37:22.733
You don't drink?

37:23.444 --> 37:25.000
We don't drink when talking about work.

37:25.822 --> 37:27.488
Your wife doesn't let you drink?

37:29.220 --> 37:31.200
Being overly aggressive
isn't a good habit.

37:33.060 --> 37:35.260
Rules have to be set
when it's time to set them.

37:39.340 --> 37:39.740
So,

37:41.060 --> 37:43.540
are you really taking this to court?

37:44.140 --> 37:44.460
Yes.

37:45.444 --> 37:46.711
I want them to compensate me

37:46.844 --> 37:47.940
and publicly apologize.

37:48.580 --> 37:49.660
But if you do that,

37:50.380 --> 37:51.940
won't everything become public?

37:52.780 --> 37:53.540
Aren't you worried

37:53.940 --> 37:55.340
about people gossiping?

37:56.180 --> 37:56.860
Not at all.

37:57.511 --> 37:59.800
It's not the first time people
have talked about me.

37:59.977 --> 38:01.740
Might as well let everyone
in the company see

38:02.060 --> 38:03.955
what happens
when they bully and defame me.

38:06.740 --> 38:07.180
Alright.

38:08.460 --> 38:09.260
In that case,

38:09.900 --> 38:10.580
I'll make sure

38:10.580 --> 38:12.020
this gets maximum exposure.

38:12.260 --> 38:12.580
Good.

38:15.860 --> 38:16.460
Then,

38:17.060 --> 38:18.300
since work is done,

38:19.022 --> 38:19.822
let's have a drink.

38:21.020 --> 38:21.420
Just one.

38:22.740 --> 38:23.180
Excuse me,

38:23.444 --> 38:24.355
liquor list, please.

38:39.700 --> 38:41.460
Your cholesterol is high.
Have some greens.

38:41.580 --> 38:41.900
Here.

38:55.555 --> 38:56.460
You order first.

38:56.980 --> 38:58.111
I'll go to the restroom.

39:26.700 --> 39:27.340
Didn't you say

39:27.340 --> 39:28.620
you wouldn't see her again?

39:33.466 --> 39:35.660
We just happened to run
into each other at a lecture.

39:35.660 --> 39:36.890
What's wrong with
having a meal together?

39:36.890 --> 39:37.580
A lecture?

39:38.177 --> 39:39.933
You think she understands any of that?

39:40.420 --> 39:42.020
All she cares about is houses and cars.

39:42.260 --> 39:43.940
You're being way too controlling.

39:45.222 --> 39:47.288
What's wrong with
wanting a house and a car?

39:47.290 --> 39:47.900
Is it illegal?

39:47.900 --> 39:48.740
No.

39:49.340 --> 39:51.260
But wanting mine is not acceptable.

39:52.140 --> 39:53.140
We're genuinely in love.

39:53.380 --> 39:54.466
Please show some mercy.

39:55.580 --> 39:57.420
You're "in love" when he has money,

39:57.577 --> 39:59.540
and when he doesn't,
it's "fate has ended."

39:59.688 --> 40:01.660
Even sex workers
have more dignity than you.

40:01.660 --> 40:02.260
Zhou!

40:24.220 --> 40:25.420
That was too far.

40:32.940 --> 40:34.100
Zhou Mei, listen carefully.

40:35.140 --> 40:36.660
You only get to say that once.

40:40.088 --> 40:40.977
What are you doing?

40:41.000 --> 40:41.533
You...

40:42.060 --> 40:42.540
Zhou,

40:43.980 --> 40:44.500
are you okay?

40:47.380 --> 40:47.780
I'm fine.

40:48.020 --> 40:48.780
Who is he?

40:50.220 --> 40:50.980
Your new boyfriend

40:52.020 --> 40:52.660
or your boss?

40:53.300 --> 40:54.300
He's my lawyer.

40:55.780 --> 40:57.060
So you'd better watch yourself.

40:57.980 --> 40:58.580
You, too.

41:25.660 --> 41:28.620
♪My heart is beating still♪

41:29.740 --> 41:32.660
♪Sometimes I feel alone♪

41:33.420 --> 41:36.500
♪But love should not be frail♪

41:38.700 --> 41:39.380
Just now,

41:39.977 --> 41:41.755
why didn't you let me call the police?

41:44.700 --> 41:45.466
He's my father.

41:48.900 --> 41:50.288
Every bit of money my dad makes

41:51.220 --> 41:52.380
gets taken by women.

41:53.780 --> 41:54.466
You know that?

41:55.355 --> 41:56.500
I have two younger brothers.

41:57.740 --> 41:58.980
The three of us

42:00.140 --> 42:01.700
have different mothers.

42:02.220 --> 42:02.980
♪I guess♪

42:02.980 --> 42:08.220
♪It's rising from my silence♪

42:09.820 --> 42:12.300
♪I'm nothing but the one♪

42:12.300 --> 42:15.200
Make sure you protect your share
of the assets and your mother's.

42:15.620 --> 42:16.420
If necessary,

42:17.100 --> 42:18.700
I can help you get everything notarized.

42:19.100 --> 42:20.740
♪And past pain♪

42:20.900 --> 42:22.540
♪I'd still try♪

42:22.540 --> 42:24.377
You'll probably laugh
at me for saying this,

42:25.660 --> 42:26.620
but my mom, even now,

42:26.980 --> 42:28.420
is still waiting for him to change.

42:28.420 --> 42:29.660
♪Please stay with me♪

42:30.340 --> 42:33.780
♪I could've held you in my arms♪

42:34.340 --> 42:36.580
♪When I said love♪

42:36.580 --> 42:39.580
♪Hurts somehow♪

42:41.380 --> 42:44.980
♪Please stand by me♪

42:45.780 --> 42:46.220
Waitress,

42:46.511 --> 42:47.420
two more drinks.

42:48.100 --> 42:48.500
Alright.

42:52.380 --> 42:53.540
Didn't you say just one?

42:54.800 --> 42:56.400
I'm drinking with you tonight.

43:05.220 --> 43:06.700
The company hasn't seen
any contract with him.

43:07.020 --> 43:08.300
I registered a brand-new one.

43:08.940 --> 43:09.620
To guard against us?

43:10.060 --> 43:11.220
It's him I'm guarding against, not you.

43:12.100 --> 43:12.820
A female partner?

43:14.180 --> 43:14.820
I don't agree.

43:15.460 --> 43:16.780
When you can bring in
ten million in investment,

43:17.620 --> 43:18.940
then you can disagree.

43:19.780 --> 43:20.900
Congratulations, Ms. Lin.

43:20.900 --> 43:22.500
(Chapter 63: Music and Dance Mystery)
That was quite a deceptive move.

43:22.500 --> 43:23.620
But I'm busy right now,

43:24.780 --> 43:26.540
Why are you bringing up a breakup

43:26.540 --> 43:27.860
when I'm at my absolute best?

43:28.020 --> 43:30.260
Wouldn't it be even scummier
to leave when you're down?

43:34.140 --> 43:35.180
He Han still loves you.

43:39.080 --> 43:40.200
(I've been thinking.)

43:41.480 --> 43:44.760
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:45.520 --> 43:52.850
(is probably different.)

43:53.850 --> 43:55.600
♪If the sky♪

43:56.110 --> 43:57.510
♪And the sea♪

43:58.050 --> 43:59.760
♪Turned upside down♪

44:01.320 --> 44:03.250
♪If a swimming fish♪

44:03.650 --> 44:07.040
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

44:08.810 --> 44:10.780
♪If back then♪

44:11.140 --> 44:15.550
♪We had never let go♪

44:16.150 --> 44:22.430
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

44:23.550 --> 44:25.700
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

44:25.700 --> 44:27.570
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

44:27.750 --> 44:30.190
♪And found our way back whole♪

44:31.030 --> 44:33.200
♪So let this surging love♪

44:33.200 --> 44:37.630
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:38.530 --> 44:40.710
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:40.710 --> 44:41.800
♪That's alright♪

44:42.340 --> 44:43.090
♪If we're buried♪

44:43.090 --> 44:45.790
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:46.050 --> 44:48.230
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:48.410 --> 44:52.830
♪This one eternal photograph♪

45:08.590 --> 45:10.880
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

45:10.880 --> 45:12.640
♪Running in opposite ways♪

45:12.760 --> 45:15.230
♪Searching all along the way♪

45:16.030 --> 45:18.190
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

45:18.380 --> 45:23.290
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

45:23.290 --> 45:26.810
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

45:27.050 --> 45:28.020
♪Only after loss♪

45:28.020 --> 45:30.650
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

45:31.060 --> 45:33.420
♪In another time and space♪

45:33.420 --> 45:34.980
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:34.980 --> 45:37.810
♪Till we grow old♪

45:38.770 --> 45:41.060
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:41.060 --> 45:43.730
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:46.250 --> 45:48.660
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:48.660 --> 45:53.870
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
